 "remarks": "Discover effortless, turnkey living in the heart of New Canaan at Essex Ridge. Completely reimagined in 2023, this beautifully renovated 3-bedroom, 3.5-bath townhouse combines modern sophistication, thoughtful upgrades, and an exceptional walk-to-town location. Sun-filled interiors feature new flooring, a redesigned staircase, and inviting living and dining spaces adjoining a stunning updated kitchen with new appliances, contemporary finishes, and range hood.  Upstairs, three spacious bedrooms offer comfortable retreats, while all 3.5 bathrooms have been beautifully renovated. The finished lower level provides versatile space for a home office, recreation room, or gym, complemented by a new laundry room with built-ins.  Extensive improvements include new windows, HVAC system, tankless water heater, sump pump, updated electrical, and smart-home features including thermostats, video doorbell, and exterior security camera. A private patio surrounded by lush landscaping and a mature hydrangea tree offers a peaceful outdoor retreat. Two dedicated parking spaces add convenience.  Ideally located approximately 10 minutes on foot from New Canaan's vibrant village center and Metro-North train station, offering an easy NYC commute, with boutique shopping, acclaimed restaurants, and the New Canaan Library all within easy reach. An exceptional end-unit retreat offering privacy, comfort, and effortless living. Your next chapter in New Canaan begins here. Schedule your private tour!",
